{"_id":"64b395e4541cdc68ba11591a","uploaderId":"639358aa4c2c822decc671e1","uploaderName":"Anonymous","uploaderAvatarUrl":null,"name":"绽放在世界终焉","desc":"已尝试将主旋律进行分离\n游玩建议：选用Lunatic 开启Track3，Track13，Track17。\n若想提高难度可开启Track18，Track16或其他音轨\n---------------------------------------\n转载并修改自：https://space.bilibili.com/1664494\n东方雪莲华steam:https://store.steampowered.com/app/1000440/__Abyss_Soul_Lotus/\n=======================\n◇绽放在世界终焉\n\nLast Spell Card的主题曲。\n\n 参考了其他类型的游戏Boss战，做出了一首恢弘的终幕曲。\n 使用了很多方法来做旋律的变奏，不知道大家能听出多少呢。\n 将雪莲华的管乐风格延续到了最后，\n 铜管组在收尾时终于成为了主旋律乐器，可喜可贺（？）。\n\n===========\n\n祝贺雪莲华顺利发布，今天是双投稿！\n不知道现在有多少人成功见到了LSC呢？\n电吉他、大鼓、编钟和铜管组的搭配，意外地很有终盘的感觉。\n曲名也是如大家所想，与夏夜祭的“闪耀在世界尽头”一脉相承了。\n不绽放在世界终焉，和咸鱼有什么区别！","hash":"ad33671c82841c6e4c93ace68287d337","coverUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/8efbdcbad4480f58ab0497ae37b91df5-blur.png","coverBlurUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/8efbdcbad4480f58ab0497ae37b91df5-blur.png","artistName":"Tokini11","artistUrl":"https://space.bilibili.com/1664494","songId":"65a1609004bfae42a36b4be7","authorId":null,"song":{"_id":"65a1609004bfae42a36b4be7","albumId":"64c924b6541cdc68ba11a3e7","composerId":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","name":"绽放在世界终焉","track":18,"localNewCount":0},"album":{"_id":"64c924b6541cdc68ba11a3e7","name":"東方雪蓮華 ～ Abyss Soul Lotus.","abbr":null,"date":"2023-08-01T15:28:54.263Z","coverPath":"/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-cover.jpg","coverBlurPath":"/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-blur.png","coverUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-cover.jpg","coverBlurUrl":"https://storage.thmix.org/imgs/69e274114d67cfae7af489ff55395f53-blur.png","localNewCount":0},"author":{"_id":null,"name":null},"composer":{"_id":"65a15c5804bfae42a36b4bc0","name":"Anonymous"},"uploadedDate":"2023-07-16T07:01:56.969Z","approvedDate":null,"status":"INCLUDED","sourceArtistName":"Tokini11","sourceAlbumName":"東方雪蓮華 ～ Abyss Soul Lotus.","sourceSongName":"绽放在世界终焉","trialCount":16,"downloadCount":190,"loveCount":2,"vote